# hooks

## Назначение

React hooks: context consumers, browser API wrappers.

## Структура

```
{feature}/
├── index.ts
├── hook.ts
└── hook.interface.ts
```

## Naming

| Hook | Interface |
| ---- | --------- |
| `useAlerts` | `UseAlertsProps` |
| `useLocalStorage` | `UseLocalStorageProps` |

## Context hooks

```ts
export function useAlerts(): UseAlertsProps {
  const context = useContext(AlertsContext);
  if (!context) {
    throw new Error('useAlerts must be used within <AlertsProvider>');
  }
  return context;
}
```

- Import context из `providers/`, не duplicate createContext
- Guard throw — обязателен

## Storage hooks

`hooks/storage/local/`, `hooks/storage/cookie/` — wrap services или direct browser API.

## index.ts

```ts
export const useAlerts = BaseUseAlerts;

export namespace useAlerts {
  export type Props = UseAlertsProps;
}
```

Re-export из `./hook`; типы из `hook.interface.ts`.

## Правила

1. Hooks **не** содержат JSX (кроме rare render hooks — избегать)
2. **Не** axios/SWR в mosuk-ui hooks — это CRM app concern
3. Side effects — в provider; hook читает context/state
4. Feature-local hooks в `component/.partials/hooks/` — для compound components (toggle)

## Эталоны

- `src/hooks/alerts/` — context consumer
- `src/hooks/storage/local/` — browser API
- `src/components/actions/toggle/component/.partials/hooks/` — feature-local
